# wasm-bindgen output fingerprinted by public/wasm/manifest.json. Formatting it
# drifts the committed artifact from its recorded hash, and it carries no review
# value because nothing here is hand-maintained. The specs beside it are, so the
# generated files are named by extension rather than by ignoring the directory:
# a re-include cannot resurrect a file whose parent directory is excluded, so
# `src/modules/AudioEngine/wasm/` plus `!.../__tests__/` would silently take the
# hand-written specs out of every formatter's reach.
src/modules/AudioEngine/wasm/*.js
src/modules/AudioEngine/wasm/*.d.ts

